OL,3,GNEWSANottingham attacks family condemn
OL,4,Apolice promotion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanjoy Kumar, Grace's dad, told the BBC
OL,7,Fon Friday: "I think this is completely
OL,8,Fwrong."
